WEBVTT

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.910
Last time on The Demon Girl Next Door.

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:06.540
I encountered a new Magical Girl character
while out working a job.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:10.120
SHAMIKO

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:10.120
SHAMIKO IS PARALYZED WITH SHOCK...

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:11.790
Don't tell me...

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.160
Please don't tell me that outfit means...

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.870
Hey, does that flyer have a map on it?

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.160
Can you give me one?

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.330
OKAY!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.620
This is where I'd like to go,
can you tell me how to get there?

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:28.290
That's the plaza you're actually in right now.

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:29.910
Oh, really?

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:32.330
It looks pretty different from how it used to,
so I didn't even notice.

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:35.120
Um... are you on a casual cosplay vacation?

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.330
Nope.

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:38.200
I'm just a Magical Girl passing through.

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:41.160
Oh crap! Oh crap! Oh crap...!

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:40.000
Are you okay?

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.200
Did you bump your head or something?

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.000
If you want to put it that way, I just bumped into
the one thing that I really didn't want to bump into!

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.370
What brought you all the way here in that outfit?

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:49.250
Please tell me it's sightseeing!

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.950
Not at all. I'm actually on patrol right now.

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:55.750
From what I hear, the Magical Girl in this city
had a bad confrontation with a Demon.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:56.750
Yeah...

00:00:56.910 --> 00:01:00.250
Apparently, she was severely injured after their
fierce battle and had the magic drained from her.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:02.500
And now she's become a slave to that Demon.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.000
What the hell?! I don't know
who gave you that impression!

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:03.500
WHAT
THE
HELL?!

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:07.410
Does that mean you're familiar
with what's been happening?

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:09.200
Uh, um, not really!

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.790
I just think whoever gave you that info
must only explain things in super broad strokes!

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:16.290
To be honest, I really didn't think the Magical Girl
of this city would ever get beaten like that.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:19.040
I totally agree! Whatever you heard is fake news!

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:21.450
That's why I'm on the lookout
for a Demon that fits the bill.

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:24.250
I figured I would start by gauging their reaction
after a pound down.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:27.450
"Pound Down" Definition 1:
To strike heavily or repeatedly.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:33.910
"Pound down" Verb (transitive)
Definition 1: To strike heavily or repeatedly.
Or to reduce to pulp by beating.
Example: "I want to pound that Demon down."
Definition 2: Slang for to drink or consume something rapidly.
Example: "Hey cutie, why don't
we pound down some tea?"

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:29.200
Example: "I want to pound that Demon down."

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:32.000
Definition 2: Slang for to drink
or consume something rapidly.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.910
Example: "Hey cutie, why don't we
pound down some tea?"

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:36.250
Hey, is it just me or are you acting a little strange?

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:37.000
No...

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:39.950
If I take off this costume, I just know
she's going to throw me with all her might!

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:53.580
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:56.540
The sun is shining too brightly

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:59.370
(I rubbed my eyes from the glare)

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:02.290
I took off without even thinking

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:04.830
(It's time for us to spark the joy)

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:10.580
When I hold back my swaying bangs with my left hand

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:15.160
These familiar sights start to shine

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:16.370
(Three, two, one)

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:21.410
We want to share our secret, right now

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:27.950
Anything is possible for us

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.950
(Always stay by my side)

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.120
For sure

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.620
(We trust each other)

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:36.580
On that street corner we found a precious treasure

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:42.370
Even if you went far away, I would definitely run after you

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:48.450
Our future is here, forever burning bright

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:53.660
The fun is only just getting started

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:15.000
The Cursed Fruit!!
Beware the Sour Mikan!!

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:19.080
I finished handing out all the flyers, but I can't quit yet.

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:23.290
Because this girl who wants to throw me into oblivion
is following me all the way to the changing room!

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:26.330
Hey, you've been acting pretty suspicious
for a while now.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:27.660
Now she even suspects something!

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.620
Sorry, but would you mind taking off that costume?

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:33.080
Huh?! B-but Miss Tama Sakura isn't a costume, tee-hee!

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.910
Okay, I get you're really dedicated to playing the role.

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.790
But you've got sweat leaking out
from just about everywhere.

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:38.120
This is just Tama juice!

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:38.700
"Tama juice"?

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.330
I knew it, something is really off about you!

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:44.040
Your voice is quivering way more than it was earlier.
Come back here with me!

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:45.200
Things are just getting worse!

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:47.120
Huh? Was that Miss Tama Sakura?

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:49.540
Strip it off, right now!

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:50.750
I-I won't do it!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.790
If it's difficult to get off, then I'll help you.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:53.580
I won't do it!

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:54.200
Strip.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:54.950
I won't do it!

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.290
That's enough, it's coming off!

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:59.910
If we keep shouting stuff like this in a back alley,
then people will definitely get the wrong idea!

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:02.200
Horns...?

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.700
I... don't want the pound down.

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:06.040
C... C...

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:08.250
Crisis Management!

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:16.160
Are you a Demon Girl?

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:21.160
I managed to transform on impulse.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:24.660
Is this because of all the training that I did with Momo?

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.290
But this is bad, I have zero ideas about what to do next!

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:28.830
So, hey...

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.620
Maybe I gave you the wrong impression somehow.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:34.410
I was being harsh on you earlier because I thought
you might be suffering from heatstroke.

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:36.450
I didn't want you to actually strip down to nothing.

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:40.040
I don't really know what's going on with you,
but please accept my apologies.

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:41.620
She gave me something to cover up with out of pity!

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:44.000
A-aren't you going to pound me down?

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:42.750
Sob...

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.950
I would never pound down on someone
so weak and defenseless!

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:48.000
Do you know how to revert your transformation?

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.580
I'm afraid I have no idea.

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:53.330
Um, well... you need to loosen up mentally,
like make your brain go limp.

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:54.750
"Go limp"?

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:56.250
What are you doing back here?

00:04:56.870 --> 00:04:58.870
Shamiko and... Mikan?

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:00.290
Ah! Momo!

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.540
I'm here just like you asked!

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:04.120
I want to see you bow your head so far
in appreciation that it melts into the ground!

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:05.370
A friend of yours?

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:09.750
She's a friend, but I'm still debating about
whether to call the cops. What is going on?

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.080
Don't! This is all a misunderstanding!

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.370
This is Mikan Hinatsuki.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:15.790
She's a Magical Girl I called in to help us out.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:19.500
Things got really complicated
while I was waiting for you around here.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:23.660
Momo Chiyoda (Fresh Peach)

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:23.660
A demon stole my magic.

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:21.700
A demon stole my magic.

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:22.370
Huh?

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:23.660
Huh?

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:23.660
I need your help.

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:23.370
I need your help.

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:27.450
I temporarily lifted the barrier, so you should be able
to pick up on the Demon's presence.

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:27.700
I temporarily lifted the barrier,
so you should be able to pick up
on the Demon's presence.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:29.120
Hold up, I don't know what you're talking about.

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:30.040
Hold up, I don't know
what you're talking about.
Are you okay?

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:32.750
Are you okay? Do you have a place to stay?
Actually, your explanation lacks way too much detail!

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:34.450
Do you have a place to stay?

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:34.450
And stop ignoring my messages
after I know you've read them!

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:51.790
Scary, scary, scary, scary...!

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.000
SCARY!

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.250
SCARY!

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:39.750
You had me thinking something
horrific like this was on the loose!

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.750
SCARY!

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:40.000
SCARY!

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.080
A Demon that lost their heart
and became just like Baphomet!

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.330
SCARY!

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:42.830
SCARY!

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.200
You got the wrong idea.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:44.410
SCARY!

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.410
Well I was really worried that was what happened!

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:45.790
SCARY!

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:46.080
Sorry.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:46.080
SCARY!

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.790
For
Safe
Childbirth

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.790
I even went out of my way to buy a good luck charm!

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.080
SCARY!
Here
you
are

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.660
Oh, I also brought you a gift.

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:49.290
SCARY!

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:51.790
Hinatsuki Brand
Mikan Jam Wafer Cakes

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.000
Let me stay with you tonight.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:51.790
I don't have a spare futon.

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:53.160
Why didn't you tell me sooner?!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.700
Oh, this person actually seems pretty nice.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:06:01.080
Well she's certainly no Baphomet, but I don't know
what was with that getup Shamiko was wearing earlier.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.160
I'm going to need you to explain that to me later.

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:04.080
Uh, right.

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:07.540
I'm so sorry I scared you,
especially since you're still young.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.500
What? No, that's... huh?

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.790
How old are you now?

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:13.040
I'm a first-year in high school, just like Momo.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:15.540
You can feel free to rely on me for anything,
like an older sister!

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:20.540
D-don't think this means you've won!

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:23.750
Dooooonnnn't!

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:22.290
What?

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:23.750
That girl is the same age as us.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.410
Huh? Seriously?!

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:26.330
I'm sorry!

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:30.700
Event:
Meet & Greet
with Miss Tama Sakura

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:30.700
Don't give up, Shamiko!
Become a great Demon with many allies!

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.870
It took a long time to finish cleaning up around here.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.120
That's for sure. Good work today.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:39.870
All members of the Sports Day Planning Committee
please report to the school athletic field.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.870
Oh, I need to get going.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.580
Sorry Shamiko, do you mind handling the rest?

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:43.790
Sure.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:44.830
SPIN

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.790
Anri is super busy as usual.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:48.160
Oh!

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:50.040
There you are, how convenient.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:52.450
You're the only one with horns around here,
so you must be Yuko.

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:55.410
What's with the confused look on your face?

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:56.910
"Yuko..."

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:59.120
Oh wait, that IS my name.

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:01.870
I thought we were about to have
another misunderstanding.

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:06.330
Sorry, my mom is the only one who seems to call me
by my actual name these days.

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:08.870
If I remember correctly, your name was Mikan. Right?

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:09.620
Yes.

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:14.000
I was with Momo until just a few minutes ago,
but it seems we got separated somewhere.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.120
I'd like to find her as soon as possible.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:19.370
I need to throw away all this trash first,
but I can help you look for her if you'd like.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.410
Really?

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:23.620
Nothing good will happen
just because you're nice to me, okay?

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:26.950
Though, I don't mind helping you
take out some of this trash.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:28.450
U-um, that's not trash!

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:32.160
Out of all the bags of trash here,
you didn't hesitate to single me out.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:36.080
I'm sorry, I didn't intend to confuse your ancestor
with the burnable trash.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.870
Tell me, are you a Magical Girl from some nearby town?

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:40.910
You seem like one of the peaceful types,
so why are you here?

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:43.620
I'm here to pick up the necessary forms
to transfer to this school.

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.080
Is that so?

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:46.660
Wait, transfer?!

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:51.120
I mean, I was asked to safeguard Yuko...
is this really that surprising to you?

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:53.580
Your reaction was enough to make me jump,
so please cut it out.

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.040
Transferring to a different school
means making a huge change in your life!

00:07:56.040 --> 00:08:00.410
You would do that just for our pitiful clan of Demons
whose statues get mistaken for burnable trash?

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.870
I was the one in the wrong here,
so don't degrade yourself over it!

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:06.870
Momo reached out to me for help,
so I want to do everything that I can.

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:09.080
There's still some trash lying around here.

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:13.790
Hey, Shamiko. Is it just me or does this Mikan girl
seem a lot more levelheaded than Momo is?

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.830
But it's possible that she's hiding an obsession
with training or something.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.040
Excuse me, Mikan!

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:20.250
Which do you prefer: a dumbbell or a flower?!

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:21.500
Where did that come from all of a sudden?

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:22.790
I suppose I'd prefer a flower...

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:27.200
You're an ordinary girl!

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:29.290
Wh-what do you mean by that?

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:30.750
And why are you crying?

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:31.620
Well...

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:35.040
Momo told me that most Magical Girls out there
aren't very pleasant to deal with,

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.250
so I was a bit concerned.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.580
But you seem like a really nice person,
so I'm just relieved.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:42.290
L-look, nothing good will happen
if you keep smooth talking me. Okay?

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:45.580
I'm really not as reliable as you may think that I am.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:46.160
Huh?

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:50.450
In fact, Momo may be having trouble right now
because of my power acting up.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:51.830
Momo's in trouble?

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:56.620
Yes, she might be wandering around town right now
in a state that would get her questioned by the police!

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:58.750
That's why we've got to find her ASAP!

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:00.870
What exactly is your power anyway?

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:02.200
RED TEAM

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:04.790
WHITE TEAM
RED TEAM

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.290
Oh, Anri...

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:07.000
Yellowtail Prize
Japan's #1
Party Rocker

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:08.120
Sorry to be so abrupt, but have you seen a girl
wearing a different school's uniform around?

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:10.370
OAK
LEAF
MOCHI

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:10.370
Momochiyo! What is up with that outfit?!

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:12.120
You're like a walking billboard!

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:13.910
What's up? Are you going to a party?

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:17.750
This is the result of me being caught up
in various disasters because of Mikan's power.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:23.410
OAK
LEAF
MOCHI

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:20.910
I'm in a hurry, so let's just put aside any questions
about why I look like this for right now...

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:24.080
I'm not mature enough to just ignore everything
that's going on with you right now!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.450
I'm Birdtaro!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:29.290
I have a certain power that is
very difficult for me to control.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.450
Excuse me, are you the student
in charge of trash duty today?

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:34.450
Sorry to bother you, but could you take out
all this trash from the shredder for me?

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:36.160
Oh, sure.

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:36.250
Shamiko!

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:40.500
I'm going to be late for the ritual,
so do you mind taking these out, too?

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:43.540
They're full of chicken feathers and a bunch
of other junk leftover from our club activities!

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.950
What kind of club activities are you doing
that produce trash like that?!

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.910
Did that elixir I gave you before have any effects?

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:47.910
Wow, it's so light.

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:49.450
Tell me! Tell me!

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:49.450
It really must be full of chicken feathers.

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:51.830
Let me research you more thoroughly sometime, okay?

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.000
Later!

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.040
Okay.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:58.290
This place was looking pretty clean earlier,
but now it's just a mountain of garbage.

00:09:58.290 --> 00:09:59.370
I knew it...

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:02.250
Even now, the curse
isn't being held back strongly enough.

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:03.080
"Curse"?

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:06.500
Maybe I'm just too nervous
being in a place I'm unfamiliar with.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.330
Oh crap, my heart rate is about to shoot the roof!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:09.500
This isn't good, this isn't good!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:10.660
Yuko, make a break for it!

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:11.080
Huh?

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:13.830
You have to run away from me
before my power goes out of control!

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:14.790
What?!

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:23.200
It looks like I was too late.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.080
Momo!

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:26.700
What happened this time?

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:32.500
The garbage bags exploded and sent chicken feathers,
leaves, and shredder scraps flying everywhere.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.700
I'm sorry...

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:36.200
I guess I really haven't been able to overcome the curse.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:37.160
What curse?

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.620
All right. No problem.

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:43.830
Let's clean this place up
before the trash starts spreading out even further.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:44.870
Right.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:11:00.410
Um, so what exactly is this curse that Mikan has?

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:02.950
It's the after-effect of an incident
that I was once caught up in.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:08.450
Whenever I become distraught, the curse rains a series
of misfortunes upon the people I'm connected to.

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:19.370
MESSY

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:11.370
But it's okay because Mikan
is really thoughtful and a strong ally.

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:12.200
Even so!

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:15.200
It's my fault that since this morning
you've been covered in wet cement

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:17.250
and had the pet bird of a millionaire
suddenly thrust into your care!

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:19.950
And things seem to have only gotten worse
after we got separated, ugh...!

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:22.830
Yeah, a lot of stuff happened
but it's okay because I found you again.

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:24.660
Are you sure you're okay?!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:28.910
The curse can activate anytime
that I get too excited or flustered.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:33.500
So please don't heap any unexpected praise on me,
like "she's a good girl" or something.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.000
Well, it mostly won't be a problem.

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:39.040
I made sure to bring lots of good luck charms
and CDs that calm me down!

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:40.910
I'm not sure all of that will help too much.

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:45.870
But putting the curse aside, Mikan is a really
reliable friend. I just know she'll be a big help.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:46.370
Ugh!

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:49.450
Nothing good is going to come
from flashing your happy smile at me out of nowhere!

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:51.700
There's a huge gust of wind!
It's sending the trash everywhere!

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:51.700
Shamikooooo!

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:56.540
Are you really sure it was okay for me to come and help?

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:57.750
A curse...

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:00.080
I think her situation is pretty similar to my own.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:02.040
Um!

00:12:02.040 --> 00:12:07.250
Uh, I t-tend to forget sometimes,
but I'm a Demon Girl who targets Magical Girls!

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:10.660
So, I think it's really great to have
a somewhat inept Magical Girl around town!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:15.790
HEH
HEH
HEH
HEH
HEH

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.200
Heh, heh, heh, heh...!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.200
I'll be watching closely for any openings
to steal away your magic.

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:15.370
So just detox your blood and wait for it!

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:15.790
Ugh!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.540
Nothing good will happen if you awkwardly
try to cheer me up like that!

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:19.750
This is harder than I thought!

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:21.750
Shamikoooooo!

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:23.540
I'm sorry...

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:26.200
The curse is really coming on strong today.

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:28.200
Normally I'm much better at holding it back.

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:31.370
I think it's natural for you to be unstable
in new surroundings.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.330
I'll support you as best as I can
until you've gotten used to this city.

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:37.660
I'll do my best to keep my heart rate under control, too.

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:40.290
But you're going to transfer to our school right, Mikan?

00:12:40.290 --> 00:12:42.790
Are you sure you won't get too nervous
giving your introduction speech?

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:43.790
Can you handle it?

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:46.040
I wonder what class you'll be in?

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:52.790
Momo! At least have the decency
to spare her your silence!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.040
NON-BURNABLE TRASH
BURNABLE TRASH

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:57.000
Well, we separated and threw out all the trash we could.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.250
Are you sure you don't want us to wait for you?

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:03.120
It's okay. You've done more than enough
to help, thanks so much.

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:05.080
Okay, then we're going to have a strategy meeting.

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:06.660
"A strategy meeting"?

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:07.370
Yep.

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:09.580
CLEANING SUPPLIES

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:13.000
Ancestor, I'm really glad
that Mikan seems like a nice person.

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:14.580
Shall we head home now?

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.160
WASSUP!!

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:17.620
GREEN TEA

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.000
Wassup!

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:17.620
Huh?! This isn't my Ancestor!

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:22.200
Shamiko! Help me! Shamiko! Help me!

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:19.080
Where did the real statue go?!

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:20.040
Huh?

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:21.000
SHAMIKO

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.370
HELP ME!

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:24.120
Shamiko! Help me!

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:23.660
SHAMIKO

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:24.120
HELP ME!

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.370
Don't think this means you've won!

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:31.790
Don't give up, Shamiko! Do your best at keeping things
tidy and become a virtuous Demon!

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:31.790
Grumble, grumble, grumble, grumble...

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:33.540
Gaaah!

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:39.040
THE SECRET OF THE FRESH PEACH TRANSFORMATION

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.580
Momo's total transformation time
is roughly 0.01 seconds!

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:39.000
In this anime we show it to you in super slow motion!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.790
TAMA RIVER

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.950
Recently, Momo has started
to kidnap me after school every day.

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:44.620
Or rather, she calls me to come and join her for training.

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:47.040
Grumble...

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.700
But why is Mikan coming along, too?

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:51.370
By the way, Shamiko. I wanted to ask you
about your eccentric wardrobe the other day...

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:52.620
The other day?

00:13:52.620 --> 00:13:55.000
When you and Mikan met each other for the first time.

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:57.160
Oh, you mean my Miss Tama Sakura costume?

00:13:57.160 --> 00:14:00.450
No. For starters, Miss Tama Sakura is not eccentric at all.

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:03.120
In fact, as far as mascot characters go
she has one of the most orthodox appearances.

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:05.500
But that's not because they were lazy
with her design or anything,

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:07.950
rather they were aiming for a simple standard
that eliminated the fluff as much as possible.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.660
They held nothing back, but never added too much
and when the big mascot character craze is over

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.660
Okay, that's enough! I'm sorry! Please calm down!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:13.790
And actually, what is up with all this passion you have
for Miss Tama Sakura?!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.330
she will avoid falling into the pitfall of quirkiness

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:13.790
and break through with a straight punch that-

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:17.500
So, what did you mean by eccentric wardrobe?

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.120
You were naked back at the shopping mall, weren't you?

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:21.290
"Naked"?

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:24.000
Why would you phrase it like that?!

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.750
I wasn't naked! I was half-naked if anything!

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:26.950
There's no point in arguing semantics here.

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.500
Don't try and give me that crap!

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:30.620
There is a very stark difference
between naked and half-naked!

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:32.910
Is that supposed to be your Battle form?

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:34.410
It's my Crisis Management form.

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:36.370
I don't really understand the specifics myself, though.

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:38.750
Would you mind doing the explaining for me, Ancestor?

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:44.000
It's an optimal form that I produced which is designed
to strengthen the latent powers of our clan!

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:46.870
Does that mean she's powered up while transformed?

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:48.540
Slightly more than normal, yes.

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:49.500
Okay.

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:52.660
If she wills it, would Shamiko be able
to transform at any time?

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.620
My name is Shadow Mistress Yuko, 15 years old!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.500
I'm just your friendly, neighborhood pervert!

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:01.950
In the morning, at night, during class...
could she even stay transformed around the clock?

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:04.200
If Shamiko managed to have enough focus, yes.

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:06.000
Stop consulting over these terrifying ideas!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:06.910
Okay, Shamiko.

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:10.580
I want to test your abilities in your
Crisis Management form, so try transforming right here.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:13.200
Right out in public like this?!
I refuse! That's too embarrassing!

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.540
But if either you or the city end up facing danger,

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:19.160
then it won't matter if you're in public or not
because you'll have to transform regardless.

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:20.120
Seriously...?

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:23.700
Fine. I'll agree to transform,
but only if you do it with me, Momo.

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:24.950
Not up for it? Heh, heh, heh.

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:25.500
Okay.

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:27.000
All done.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.580
Your turn Shamiko, let's go.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:31.120
I totally forgot. Momo is totally the type
to transform wherever.

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:33.620
It's been such a long time
since I last saw Momo's Battle form!

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:35.250
She is just such a cutie patootie!

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:38.330
But have you stopped doing that thing you did
back in elementary school?

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:41.370
You would always do those adorable spins
during your transformation, right?

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.790
Don't you think that was better?

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:43.660
Mikan...
"Spins?!"

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:44.870
Mikan, tell me more!

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:49.290
Back in the day, Momo would often spin around
and wink during her transformation. It was SO adorbs!

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:54.080
But after making various adjustments,
her transformation time became so fast, it's all just a blur!

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:55.450
Really?! That's such a waste!

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:56.620
I know, right?

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:59.330
During her transformation you usually get to see
smiles like this that are just bursting with joy.

00:15:59.330 --> 00:15:59.910
Mikan!

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:01.000
It burst for real!

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:01.660
What's wrong?!

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:04.290
Was that the famous Fresh Peach Heart Shower?!

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:06.540
No, that was just a normal punch.

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:09.750
But we won't be buying dinner tonight,
I'm going to cook instead.

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:12.080
Uh, maybe I shouldn't have mentioned all that.

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.120
WEAPONIZED FOOD MANUFACTURING PLANT

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.370
Please give me more details later, Mikan.

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:16.160
I want to hear all about your memories of little Momo!

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:20.540
Sorry, I remember a bunch of things but I just
forgot them all to avoid the pain of "Momo Food."

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:24.410
By the way, why are you joining us for training?

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:25.870
It's not a problem, right?

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.450
I have a lot of time to kill
until my transfer to your school is done.

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:29.830
I feel you. I totally understand your pain, Mikan.

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:34.370
It's just so sad to be thrown on the floor
of your room and left out of all the fun, right?

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:34.370
Sniff... sniff...! Sniff...

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:34.950
Ugh!

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:37.080
I'm totally not sad or lonely or anything like that!

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.870
Oh crap, this isn't good. I need to calm down.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.870
Oh no, Ancestor just got trapped
by this huge snake that was passing by!

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:42.790
I'd feel terrible if Momo ended up
having to run across the desert again.

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:45.700
Wait, did Momo have to run
across a desert to get here today?!

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:45.700
Breathe in. Breath out. Breath in, breathe in, breath in!

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:49.290
It's okay, Mikan. Just calm down.

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:52.120
You don't have to worry at all
about causing any problems for me.

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:54.290
You're more than strong enough to make up for it.

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.750
I believe that you'll become
the most powerful ally we have.

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:57.700
Momo...

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:01.330
You're definitely not going
to set my heart aflutter by saying all that!

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:01.330
Gah! ANCESTOOOOORRRR!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.450
Anyway, you made a promise.

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:05.450
Get to transforming. You can do it.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:08.330
I feel like you're being more pushy than usual, Momo.

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:14.700
Crisis Management!

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:18.500
Good afternoon.

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:20.080
Good afternoon.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:20.830
Huh?

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:23.620
Crisis Management! Crisis Management!

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:24.910
Crisis Management?

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:27.040
Crisis... CRISIS MANAGEMENT!

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:28.700
Sorry.

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:31.000
Your apologies only make me feel worse, you know!

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:33.250
I don't understand why I can't transform...

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:36.660
That's because you don't actually feel
like you're in a crisis right now.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:39.580
One unique trait of that form
is the transformation being triggered

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:41.870
by the strong flow of magic that's created
when you're frightened.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:42.830
I get it.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.540
EEK!

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.580
Why did you tie my tail to the sign?

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:48.450
For your sake and for the sake of the city.

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:50.370
Why are you holding that staff right now?!

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:52.290
For your sake and for the sake of the city.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:56.620
If it means you'll be able to grow stronger, then I'm
even willing to use the Fresh Peach Heart Shower.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:57.790
Somebody save me! Somebody save me!

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:02.040
It's okay, Fresh Peach Heart Shower
is an attack I can stop just before it hits.

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:04.290
B-but it sounds like an attack that you shoot at someone!

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:05.500
Okay, here we go.

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:06.410
EEK!

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:08.080
But I'm kind of excited to finally see it!

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:08.080
Three, two...!

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:10.000
Huh?

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:10.750
I can't do it.

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:11.250
Momo?

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:12.870
The exhaustion from the past few days
is starting to hit me.

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.370
Momo, are you okay?

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:16.700
I'm going to sleep for a few minutes.

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:24.620
Lately, I feel like Momo has been even more intense
about getting things done than she was before.

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:28.200
Maybe the drain on her magic is worse than expected
and she's panicking a bit.

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:31.080
I hope I'll be able to at least
take some of the burden off of her...

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:34.910
At the very least I'm going to have to learn
to control my anxiety when watching the TV.

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:37.950
You might want to consider just not watching it at all...

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:37.250
Behind you! Behind you!

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.910
Things might end poorly if this keeps up.

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:42.160
What do you mean by that?

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.910
Well, you know that Magical Girls
sometimes dematerialize

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:46.870
if they use up too much of their magic, right?

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:49.410
We have to be sure not to put any more strain on her.

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:51.580
Hm, I see.

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:54.000
Wait, what did you just say?! They dematerialize?!

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.410
Huh? You didn't know?!

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:57.290
Maybe Momo was hiding it from you.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:59.200
Oh crap, have I screwed up yet again?

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:02.620
Mikan, the curse is starting to take effect,
so please calm down!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:10.830
Magical Girls have their bodies nearly
entirely reformatted to become an ether of magic.

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:12.830
Are you aware of that much?

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:14.290
Momo did tell me about that.

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:18.370
That's why, when a Magical Girl loses all of their magic,

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:21.910
the bonds holding their body together disappear
and they become unable to maintain a physical form.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:25.790
They don't die, but their soul just ends up
being scattered apart into the air.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:27.950
And it's difficult to come back from that on their own.

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:31.450
That means when I took some of her blood before...

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:33.790
It might have been really dangerous
depending on the amount.

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:36.910
It's dangerous for me, too. Although I don't plan
on letting you take any from me.

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:40.580
I had no idea! The priests of the Light Clan
really have it rough these days!

00:19:40.870 --> 00:19:43.660
It makes sense that Yuko might not know,
but even YOU weren't aware of it?!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:45.330
Not at all.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:51.660
Why didn't she tell me about something so important?

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:56.000
For Momo's sake I want to be more....

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:58.040
Be more...

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:00.330
...more what, exactly?

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:08.120
Oh, sorry. I'm all right now.

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:09.870
Momo!

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:12.200
I'm going to work even harder!

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:14.000
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:15.330
No matter what it takes!

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:17.500
I won't go home today
until I've figured out how to transform!

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:22.540
For now, just think about a way
that we can scare me half to death.

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:24.370
You don't have to transform!

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:25.830
Really, what's gotten into you?

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:26.950
I just...!

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:29.830
I want you to... acknowledge me.

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:30.620
Huh?

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:33.410
I mean, as your adversary! Just as an adversary!

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:35.160
I understand.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:38.330
I won't enjoy it, but if you insist then I'll do it.

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:42.200
Which do you prefer: a lunging punch,
an ankle lock or a one-armed shoulder throw?

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:45.700
Actually, you still seem really tired,
so let's do this tomorrow.

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:47.000
Take care!

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:47.910
Ugh!

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:51.040
It's okay, I'm more than capable
of physical activity right now.

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:54.200
I'm sensing a sharper bloodlust coming from you
now than when you were transformed!

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:56.450
Just stay calm.
I'll use the backside of my blade, so to speak.

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:58.500
When it comes to your fist that just means
you're going to backhand me!

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:08.620
You transformed. That's great.

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:08.620
Sob, sob...! Sob, Sob...!

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:12.040
Sob, sob...!

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.660
Sob! Sob!

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:17.830
I'll get you back for thiiiiiis!

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:17.830
Make sure to remember how you felt just now, Shamiko!

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:20.160
Don't give up, Shamiko!

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:23.200
Know your enemy and know yourself even better.

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:26.160
IMAGINARY DEPICTION

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:26.160
I'll get you back for thiiiiiis!

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:30.370
THE DEMON GIRL NEXT DOOR
"ALL IS MADE CLEAR!! THE SECRET OF THE CRISIS MANAGEMENT FORM"

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:30.370
"All is Now Made Clear!
The Secret of the Crisis Management Form!"

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:32.700
I can't walk around the city dressed like this!

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:34.950
I want a retake done on it right away, please!

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:37.410
Do you really think this outfit is that strange?

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:40.870
The problem has nothing to do with whether
it's strange or not! It's about public safety!

00:21:40.870 --> 00:21:43.330
At this rate I'm going to be making my debut
on a wanted poster real soon!

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:43.370
Be on the lookout for suspicious persons!

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:47.200
But whenever you're in that form
all of your abilities are slightly enhanced.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:47.750
Huh?

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:51.500
You could finish a whole 50-yard dash
in just over 9 seconds.

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:51.500
Wow! Amazing!

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:55.000
And with some practice,
you could even do a handstand forward roll!

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:58.910
If I could do a handstand forward roll,
then I wouldn't have to suffer the pain

00:21:58.910 --> 00:22:01.120
of falling flat on my back whenever we practice
on the mat in gym class.

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:01.750
Blegh!

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:04.370
Oh, but is it really okay to go to gym class in this outfit?

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:04.870
No, it'd be big trouble!

00:22:04.370 --> 00:22:08.660
It also makes you just a little bit smarter,
so it could even come in handy on a test.

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:10.500
But only if you study enough beforehand!

00:22:10.500 --> 00:22:12.750
But taking a test in this outfit would be difficult!

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:17.870
Conclusion: It's amazing just how unrelated this form is
to any battles against the Magical Girls.

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:20.250
Just know that it's amazing!

00:22:22.410 --> 00:22:33.950
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:41.160
Gallantly, I demand a duel

00:22:41.160 --> 00:22:42.700
I go at it, but I lose

00:22:42.700 --> 00:22:43.910
It's beyond disappointing

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:45.450
Shift away from that grief

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:46.870
Even when I’m feeling curt

00:22:46.870 --> 00:22:48.540
I’ll express myself with that tail

00:22:51.120 --> 00:22:52.330
There's a party in the neighborhood

00:22:52.410 --> 00:22:53.910
Even the dogs are going bow-wow

00:22:53.910 --> 00:22:55.200
Each and every last one

00:22:55.200 --> 00:22:56.660
For all four seasons

00:22:56.660 --> 00:22:59.950
When you fail just laugh it off

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:06.450
Connecting our hearts like that time once before

00:23:06.870 --> 00:23:12.290
With the miracle that we met in this town

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:19.040
Grant this wish

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:21.830
Shoulder those tires and go full throttle

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:24.620
Warning, there's still crises to manage, so enjoy

00:23:24.620 --> 00:23:30.160
Various blooming colors are spilling off the canvas

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:33.040
Now its sunset, don't bother thinking too much

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:35.290
Just go on!

00:23:35.450 --> 00:23:40.040
Come on, our compiled dreams can be any color

00:23:40.160 --> 00:23:41.830
So let's play some more

00:23:50.910 --> 00:24:05.950
Preview

00:23:51.370 --> 00:23:54.580
I'm Mikan Hinatsuki. That girl eating a mikan
in the opening is me!

00:23:54.580 --> 00:23:55.620
Oh, I hadn't noticed.

00:23:55.620 --> 00:23:57.000
It's been a long time since I've visited this city.

00:23:57.000 --> 00:23:59.160
Shamiko, in the next episode
we're going to compete on our final exams.

00:23:59.370 --> 00:24:01.120
Oh and there'll be a huge gathering
of mascot characters.

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:02.580
By the way, I asked my Ancestor for a retake

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:05.950
Final Exams!! Today I'm One of Those Brainy Demons!!

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:04.540
on the design of my Crisis Management form.

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:05.700
Wait, you did?
